### Get all teaching sessions
GET http://localhost:5500/api/teaching-sessions

### Get teaching session by id
GET http://localhost:5500/api/teaching-sessions/session-001

### Create teaching session
POST http://localhost:5500/api/teaching-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "packageId": "pkg-001",
    "date": "2026-09-25",
    "startTime": "09:00",
    "endTime": "10:00",
    "maxStudents": 3,
    "meetingLink": "https://meet.example.com/session-new"
}

### Update teaching session
PUT http://localhost:5500/api/teaching-sessions/session-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "startTime": "10:00",
    "endTime": "11:00"
}

### Delete teaching session
DELETE http://localhost:5500/api/teaching-sessions/session-001